# LifeRoute User Web Proxy & Flutter Build Configuration
# 1. Node Reverse Proxy (serve.js) runtime variables:
PORT=3003
API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
WS_HOST=127.0.0.1
WS_PORT=8080

# 2. Flutter Build Defines (--dart-define=KEY=VALUE for APK / Web builds):
# DEFAULT_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com/api
# DEFAULT_WS_URL=wss://api.your-domain.com/app/liferoute_reverb_key
# DEFAULT_WS_PORT=443
